    "en": {
      "name": "Advent of Atlantis",
      "effect": "This card's name becomes \"Umi\" while in the Spell & Trap Zone. You can only use each of the following effects of \"Advent of Atlantis\" once per turn. During your Main Phase: You can place 1 \"Atlantis, City of the Sea Dragon\" or \"Umi\" from your Deck face-up in your Field Zone. If this card is sent to the GY: You can add 1 Level 7 Sea Serpent monster from your Deck to your hand.",
      "official": false
    },
